### List Complaint reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/complaints?from={{fromDate}}&to={{toDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}

### Update Complaint resolution — management only
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/complaints/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "actionTaken": "Followed up with the customer and resolved the complaint.",
  "compensationAmountRm": 12.00
}

### Pending Report approvals — Owner, Head or Manager only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}

### Approve Report — Owner, Head or Manager only; Manager cannot self-review
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "note": "Evidence verified"
}

### Reject Report — rejection reason is compulsory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/{{reportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "note": "Void Bill photo is unreadable"
}


### Upload real Receiving photo — Owner, Head or Manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/media/receiving-photos
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EastAppReceivingBoundary

--EastAppReceivingBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="receiving-photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< {{receivingPhotoFile}}
--EastAppReceivingBoundary--

### Download Receiving photo for the active business
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/media/receiving-photos/{{receivingPhotoKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Accept: image/jpeg,image/png

### Atomically approve selected Daily Count records — all succeed or none change
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/stock/counts/bulk-review
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionIds": [
    "{{stockCountId1}}",
    "{{stockCountId2}}"
  ],
  "status": "Approved",
  "note": "Selected daily counts verified together"
}

### Record a failed face-verification attempt with GPS — photo part is optional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance/face-attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=EastAppFaceAttemptBoundary

--EastAppFaceAttemptBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="clientAttemptId"

manual-face-attempt-{{$timestamp}}
--EastAppFaceAttemptBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="intendedEventType"

CLOCK_IN
--EastAppFaceAttemptBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceAttemptedAt"

{{$isoTimestamp}}
