### Review failed face attempts for one user — Owner or Head only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance/users/{{userId}}/face-attempts?period=DAY&anchor={{reportDate}}&page=0&size=100
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}

### Download the captured failed-attempt photo — Owner or Head only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/attendance/face-attempts/{{faceAttemptId}}/photo
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Accept: image/jpeg,image/png


### Submit Daily Sales Directly (no draft step)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/sales/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{eastappToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

